# The one-punch all-in: everything the screens taught, aimed at Impossible's
# window.
#
# The old rush died feeding three-tank waves into a 3.7x economy -- mass 3
# was the design error, not the timing (log 2026-07-30). The compounding
# arithmetic says Impossible is beatable only before it compounds: one
# twenty-five unit fist, artillery behind it for the turret line, arriving
# inside the s500-1200 window, with wallet-first targeting burning the
# income row on arrival. Two extractors fund it; the economy that matters
# is the one the punch removes.

name punch
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,c_artillery
heavies none
max_workers 3
mass 25
reserve 0
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 1
